{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And now, cursed.</b> From the ground — that there shall come to him loss on account of the ground, that he sows and plants, for he was a worker of ground and the ground will no longer give harvest and fruit, and he will need to go to a distant land from the place of man his father, who is near the Garden, and he will not rest in one place but wander."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:10.474814344Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}